<title>ITALY: Bank Italy sets 5.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank Italy sets 5.0 trln lire reverse repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called a 5.0 trillion lire reverse repurchase tender for Wednesday for government securities to be resold on November 11.</p>
<p>At the previous comparable operation for 14.0 trillion lire on November 4, the maximum accepted rate stood at 8.30 percent and the average rate at 8.10 percent.</p>
</text>
